note The same walk with the hierarchical numbers attached: (step, depth, '1.2.3') in reading order. The outline, the document, the breadcrumb and the graph nodes all number steps through this one function, so a step carries the same number wherever it is shown. A child with no symbol, or whose symbol no line of the parent's slice names, sorts after its siblings that have a call line.

